  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></math> and <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math> be the positive numbers.<br />Then <math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>75</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />and <math><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>225</mn></math><br />so, <math><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>75</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>225</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>75</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>75</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>135</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Case1 <math><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>75</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />Case2 <math><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>75</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></math><br />So, larger of the two numbers is <math><mn>30</mn></math>",
